      "location": "Title area, top-left",
      "fact": "Large bold heading reads 'Reduced Screening Referrals Across Hospitals from 2012 to 2023'. A smaller gray subtitle below reads 'Referral-monitoring record shown in the dashboard summary'. The title's wording ('Reduced') conflicts with the line's overall upward movement."
    },
    {
      "location": "Plot area, full width",
      "fact": "A single orange line connects yearly points from 2012 (left) to 2023 (right). The line begins low (~1,200), rises with a mid-period dip in 2015, climbs steeply from 2020 to a peak at 2022, then dips slightly at 2023."
    },
    {
      "location": "Left vertical axis",
      "fact": "Y-axis labeled 'Screening referrals' with horizontal gridlines at 0, 800, 1600, 2400, 3200. The 2022 peak sits above the 3200 line; the 2023 point sits just above 3200."
    },
    {
      "location": "Bottom horizontal axis",
      "fact": "X-axis labeled 'Year' with tick labels 2012 through 2023 in one-year increments."
    }
  ],
  "printed_facts": [
    {
      "location": "Y-axis",
      "fact": "Series 'Screening referrals' tick values: 0, 800, 1600, 2400, 3200 (units: referrals). 2012 ≈ 1,200; 2014 ≈ 1,700; 2015 ≈ 1,400; 2017 ≈ 1,800; 2018 ≈ 2,500; 2020 ≈ 2,400; 2021 ≈ 3,250; 2022 ≈ 3,600 (peak); 2023 ≈ 3,300."
    },
    {
      "location": "X-axis",
      "fact": "Years 2012–2023; the reporting period spans the full line. End value (2023, ~3,300) is substantially higher than start value (2012, ~1,200)."
    },
    {
      "location": "Title",
      "fact": "Title states 'Reduced Screening Referrals' which contradicts the plotted increase over the period."
    }
  ],
  "public_definitions": [
    "Route to growth-focused referral follow-up",
    "Route to reduction-focused referral follow-up",
    "Route to standard referral monitoring",
    "Use the dashboard as the evidence source for selecting the appropriate screening referral follow-up pathway."
  ],
  "uncertain": [
    "The chart title says 'Reduced' while the data line clearly increases over the period; the intended pathway depends on whether the plotted values or the title wording governs the routing decision.",
    "Exact point values are read off gridlines and are approximate (e.g., 2022 peak ~3,600, 2023 ~3,300)."
  ]
